# Build outputs — regenerated by `build_vi.py`.
# VIEDIT.COM is the shipped deliverable and VIEDIT.SYM is its symbol table
# (the smoke test reads it), so both are committed; every other .COM
# (KEYTST/SCRTST stubs), the other symbol tables, listings and relocatables
# are not.
*.COM
!VIEDIT.COM
*.SYM
!VIEDIT.SYM
*.PRN
*.REL

# Smoke-test scratch: per-editor disk copies and the host files the harness
# writes into this directory via the hostbridge.
_smoke_work/
BIG.TXT
TEST.TXT
TEST.BAK
INS.TXT
OUT.TXT
OTHER.TXT
NEW.TXT
DUM1.TXT
DUMP.ASM
VIEDIT.CFG

# Simulator + tooling state
.altairsim_history
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# macOS
.DS_Store
